{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bc174fba735b9c88b1d60a8f11164247a54b67d4e3887e2aea4fb111cd17dced", "ja": "（『人狼』がテーマのドラマで、百合子が人狼を演じる\nことになった。次は村人に手をかけるシーンだが……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "77fdf7bd3443d601773df3bad4450cf6c91f466aa8e1a573ad2a3ae65d90f2bf", "ja": "夜空に響くオオカミの鳴き声……絶望する無力な\n村人たちに、容赦なく迫る牙……！　はぁ～……♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1002_p", "source_sha256": "32a27e2af6f237e6873f56bebacece407c751716bb245b9c70850bb00a4ac15a", "ja": "ゆ、百合子……お疲れ様。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "b3dd94208cf924e7d7ca86fa7bff9e5fe3b37e478076dae0c408edd0d19fe15c", "ja": "ハッ！？　{$P$}さん！\nすみません、今のだいぶ不謹慎でしたよね……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "5d83cb36168816fd67dff862dc4e03556660c0568a509f28573ebab0ed435a30", "ja": "人狼が村人を襲う残酷なシーンなのに……。\nその、私……ちょっとワクワクしちゃってて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b61abbde41d51fe53b999f71a640a7acfe9204728afabc638e5772cd67bfa786", "ja": "ワクワクか……。大変なシーンだから\n少し心配してたんだけど、大丈夫みたいだな！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "51a5cc8ab54cdcbe2ae34457886560843a3dfcc5d41309b69c06fe10586eb6ff", "ja": "ち、違うんです！　別に、残酷なシーンが\n好きっていうわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "345c9ef3b50aa92f39afafac6415457f572130be0e4e397ca992cacbe0ab8cf2", "ja": "ここまで村人を騙してきましたけど……。その全部が\nこのクライマックスに繋がってるじゃないですか。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "12a421a5452d72e7f49e731f140d33fb86fb3bcabc1f8dbd8cb829ddeb26560e", "ja": "私も演じながら、どんどんのめり込んでいって……\nついに、って思ったら……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4f5709e0bfabc81e7951b4c46ee6212a257991dd7fac5e67042ec946cd4271fa", "ja": "別に責めてるわけじゃないんだ。百合子が\n役に入りこんでるのは、本番前からわかってたし。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6a7ba6d798f995fc19917dbad72754e0e000aabae81d4094dc00b01fcd0e5b41", "ja": "慎重に、でも狡猾に計画を実行してきた人狼の\n見せ場だ。気持ちが乗ってるのはいいと思うよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "8888fda4b720fdd641c3253b21e3063c93c737cbe62627f4e4e7f68d0fb87fcd", "ja": "そ、そうですよね！　えへへ……♪　実は私、\n今回演じるオオカミのこと、すごく好きなんです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a42a86e29f17267c3931a20abc905a44f5b75a7004c2175d77ccc62ccae5d96", "ja": "自分の欲望のために、村人に化けて、騙して、\n襲って……。やってることは、悪いことですけど。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "077a2fe51da8e1ffdb34b58eab7c1fa6cadc45dd8d537058c19b100a5cb7f9e1", "ja": "でも、悪役ならではのカッコよさがあるというか……\nだから、演じていてすごく楽しいんです♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7cdb7640db932abdbaa6cf19cd2f817c8a3acc27e8da4ed507a38f98ed523fcd", "ja": "はは、それはよかった。百合子らしい人狼で、\nたくさんの魅力を引き出してくれて、ありがとな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1015_p", "source_sha256": "24e9bb46a96425658aae364b71ecaeb4a26a16d0acf3b9b286af690d289dfb9c", "ja": "人狼は、この物語にとって無くてはならない存在。\nそして次が、一番の見せ場だ……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "a8aab26dbf8fef530391d152a078d4208ac9ba2c3d5db2548b359412b1c7669a", "ja": "はい……！　ここまでの努力を無駄にしないために\n私、一生懸命演じてきます……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "6c6fe48ec65e998392a1fa6fa7bd56808bd7cfdb83e42ba9d6a669ecf14aeb4f", "ja": "この物語の主役が誰なのか、見せてあげますね！\n村人たちに、たっぷり悪夢を見せられるように♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1018_null", "source_sha256": "f4dc04f22506af67a5c99b6abfcf7dc222d67036739fcb8b20a8a2de1f0f0720", "ja": "撮影中", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "9fde79fd8a568bf4f7910ed050848af37eef76feebe27e214f14966a9ef59b28", "ja": "ふふふ……愚かな人間たち、なんて無防備なのかしら。\nすぐ近くに、牙を潜めたオオカミがいるとも知らず。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0754_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "4723c975b377fff90884e6fd97443f5467a697bf5befb20dc80fb9bcabe65f2a", "ja": "そのまま、なにも知らず寝ているといいわ。\n気付いた時には全て終わってるんだから……ふふっ♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
